# c64_top synthesizable sources, compile order (paths relative to the repository root).
# The block design c64_cpu and the IP ik64_ddr_mig (MIG) and ik64_ddr_cc (AXI clock converter)
# are generated by fpga/build_bitstream.tcl. The network core is a netlist: the closed
# netlist fpga/netlist/ik64_net_core.dcp (read by the build with read_checkpoint) defines the module
# ik64_net_core; fpga/netlist/ik64_net_core_stub.sv documents its ports.
-f fpga/hdl/common/ik64_common.f
-f fpga/hdl/ddr/ik64_ddr.f
fpga/hdl/c64_pkg.sv
# reDIP-SID (generated by tools/redip_patch.py, deviations D1..D3 in fpga/DEVIATIONS.md) and the
# DSP48 muladd substitute (D4); sid_pkg first, sid_api last.
# The +incdir makes the .svh includes and the .hex tables ($readmemh) resolve in synthesis
# (build_bitstream.tcl passes it as -include_dirs).
+incdir+third_party/redip-sid/ik64
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_pkg.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_control.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_waveform.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_envelope.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_pot.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_dac.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_voice.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_filter.sv
third_party/redip-sid/ik64/sid_api.sv
fpga/hdl/redip/muladd.sv
fpga/hdl/tmds_encoder.sv
fpga/hdl/dvi_tx.sv
fpga/hdl/c64_video.sv
fpga/hdl/sid_audio_out.sv
fpga/hdl/ps2_rx.sv
fpga/hdl/c64_oled.sv
fpga/hdl/c64_sysregs.sv
fpga/hdl/sid_player.sv
fpga/hdl/sid_strm_cdc.sv
fpga/hdl/c64_top.sv
